{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLF1ffTCtNRFXNwJkEcn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the janitor loop, and `make lint` and `go test ./internal/...` both pass. The loop runs a pass every 30 days and deletes the `.ard/<issue#>/` files of issues closed more than 90 days ago. It deletes through the shared main committer, which only accepts paths in the request's own issue directory.\n\n- **Candidates:** only numbered issue directories on main. `config.yaml` and the role directories are never touched.\n- **Re-check:** each candidate issue is re-fetched before deletion. Pull requests, reopened issues and issues labelled `ard:keep` or `ard:hold` are skipped.\n- **Failures:** if one issue's commit fails, the loop moves on to the next and the tick returns an error at the end.\n- **Cadence:** the 30-day timestamp is in memory, so a restart causes one extra scan.\n- **Search cap:** one pass handles at most 1,000 candidates, and the rest wait for later passes.\n\nSupporting changes:\n- **`gitx.ListTree`:** new method that lists files under a path at a revision.\n- **Wiring:** `janitor` is registered before the reaper in `servecmd`, and the janitor fetches main into its own ref in the controller clone.\n- **Fake GitHub client:** its search now accepts `closed:<YYYY-MM-DD`.\n- **Docs:** `docs/proposal.md`, the `--loops` help text and the layout list in `CLAUDE.md` are updated.\n\nTwo things for a maintainer to check:\n- **`CLAUDE.md`:** it is a protected path, so the PR will wait for human approval.\n- **Skipping keep/hold labels:** this goes beyond what the issue asks for.\n\nI added unit tests for the janitor and `ListTree` and updated the loop-list tests in `servecmd`. The report is at `.ard/61/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":921,"cache_read_input_tokens":63352,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":921},"output_tokens":622,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fbebf0c0-f7a1-4e30-ad80-df586c0d6495","uuid":"1526dc19-06d5-40ec-b13a-8f4091565462","timestamp":"2026-11-23T17:19:26.682Z","request_id":"req_011ChLF1fVY3yVVHusN6JfKP"}
